{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 47, :comments ["<b>Were not numbered.</b> They were not numbered by those who counted, nor did they number themselves, for they had not prepared themselves like the rest of the people to assemble and establish their genealogy. And this was before the blessed El said to Moses, אַךְ אֶת מַטֵּה לֵוִי לֹא תִפְקֹד (Numbers 1:49) — for indeed they waited to see what HaShem would command them, since He had not mentioned the tribe of Levi together with the rest of the tribes when He said וְאִתְּכֶם יִהְיוּ אִישׁ אִישׁ לַמַּטֶּה (Numbers 1:4)."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:35.407708559Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}